              = new BufferedReader(new FileReader(f));
            br.close();
          }
        } else if (manageType.equals("DELETE")) {
          File f = new File("Test_367.txt");
          if (f.exists()) {
            f.delete();
          } else { … }
        }
      } catch (IOException e) { … }
    }
  }
}

